## Priority 2 \'97 Council and partner entry point\
\
**Problem:**\
There is no clear route for councils, housing associations or developers\
who arrive at the site after a conference, referral or search. The only\
partner contact is a small `mailto:` link buried in the lease section.\
\
**Why it matters:**\
Reserved Roofs MoUs from councils are critical signals of demand that\
unlock the Phase 1 finance. A council officer who attended the National\
Climate Conference and visits the site should find an obvious path to\
a relevant conversation immediately.\
\
**Suggested solution:**\
Add a short `section-charcoal` section below the registration form\
on `index.html` with a distinct kicker ("For councils and landlords"),\
a two-sentence explanation of the Reserved Roofs model, and a single\
CTA button linking to `mailto:partnerships@weareenergy.coop`.\
No new page required. Mirrors the small callout already in the lease\
section points list but gives it proper visual weight.\
\
**Effort:** Low \'97 new HTML section, no new CSS needed.\
\
