## Priority 3 \'97 Social proof and traction signals\
\
**Problem:**\
The site currently shows no evidence of real institutional engagement\
or member demand in progress. For a site supporting a live fundraise\
this is a missed opportunity.\
\
**Why it matters:**\
The NWF pitch and conference presentation both cite council engagement\
and member demand as the validation that makes the financial model\
credible to funders. The site should reflect the same confidence.\
\
**Suggested solution:**\
- Add one proof line near the registration form: *"Currently in discussion\
  with councils on Reserved Roofs pilots."* (verify exact wording is\
  accurate before publishing)\
- Consider a live registration counter: *"XXX households have already\
  registered"* \'97 requires either a Google Sheets / Apps Script integration\
  or a manually updated figure\
- Both can sit in the existing registration section without redesign\
\
**Effort:** Low for static copy. Medium for a live counter.\
