## Priority 4 \'97 Post-lease energy abundance story\
\
**Problem:**\
The post-lease benefits \'97 free power for life, off-peak import only,\
cooperative dividends from ~2037 (~\'a3281/year), the Energy Democracy Fund\
\'97 are mentioned briefly in the lease section but do not have the visual\
weight they deserve given they are central to the long-term mission.\
\
**Why it matters:**\
"What happens after 7.75 years?" is the first question new visitors ask.\
The answer (free energy, ownership, dividends) is the most powerful part\
of the proposition and is currently undersold.\
\
**Suggested solution:**\
Add a two-column split section on `index.html` after the lease explainer:\
left column covers the lease years in brief; right column covers post-lease\
abundance. Use the existing `.split`, `.points` and `.section-cream`\
patterns \'97 no new CSS required.\
\
**Effort:** Low \'97 content and HTML only.\
