## Priority 5 \'97 Financial and impact proof strip on `about.html`\
\
**Problem:**\
The about page makes no reference to the financial strength of the model\
or the scale of the projected impact. A funder, journalist or policy\
contact arriving at `about.html` finds no credibility numbers.\
\
**Why it matters:**\
The implementation plan and NWF pitch book carry headline figures that\
are genuinely strong: NPV \'a35.1bn (3.5% Green Book), IRR 15%, \'a3311bn\
member savings, 2.7Mt CO\uc0\u8322  avoided, 50,000 jobs by 2050. None of these\
appear on the public site.\
\
**Suggested solution:**\
Add a four-stat strip on `about.html` using the existing `.section-data`\
and `.stat-grid` patterns from `index.html`. Suggested four stats:\
- \'a3311bn \'97 projected member savings to 2050\
- 2.7Mt \'97 CO\uc0\u8322  avoided to 2050\
- 50,000 \'97 jobs created by 2050\
- 15% \'97 IRR (with footnote: "at commercial 8% discount rate")\
\
All figures are confirmed in the financial model and implementation plan.\
\
**Effort:** Low \'97 copy and paste of existing stat HTML pattern.\
