## Priority 6 \'97 Phase 1 timeline section\
\
**Problem:**\
The site gives no sense of when installations begin or what the phases\
are. Visitors have no way to understand the 2026\'962028 timeline without\
reading the implementation plan.\
\
**Why it matters:**\
Councils and funders need to understand the timeline to make commitments.\
The conference presentation made this explicit: Reserved Roofs decisions\
need to happen now so the factory finance can be unlocked.\
\
**Suggested solution:**\
Add a simple three-step timeline strip on `about.html` or as a new\
`#timeline` anchor section on `index.html`:\
\
| When | What |\
|---|---|\
| 2026 | Teesworks site secured. Phase 1 finance raised. |\
| 2027 | Factory built and commissioned. First jobs and apprenticeships. |\
| Late 2027 / Early 2028 | First 501 founding members connected. |\
\
Use the existing `.steps` CSS pattern from `we-v3.4-base.css` \'97\
no new CSS required.\
\
**Effort:** Low \'97 content and HTML only.\
